    "scenesThatPass": [
      "FRANCES: It used to be that the seasons filled me with expectation. Now they seem more a hostile encroachment.\nJOAN: I thought we’d agreed not to talk about death at night? Christmas is coming. I say it each year but you’re hell to shop for.\nFRANCES: I’m simple. I want nothing.",
      "SYLVIA: The check bounced again, Mrs. Price.\nSYLVIA: Can I have cash?\nFRANCES: Do you have any cash for Sylvia?",
      "MADELEINE THE MEDIUM: No.\nFRANCES: Who is this person?",
      "FRANCES: What’s she doing?\nMADELEINE THE MEDIUM: Sorry. Do you not know?\nFRANCES: We know. We’re going to lie down. Will you come visit us later?\nMADELEINE THE MEDIUM: What’s she paying you?",
      "MME REYNARD: Oh, hey! You made it! Come on in! Let me have your coats!\nFRANCES: We’re not early?\nMME REYNARD: No, right on time.\nFRANCES: But where are the others?"
    ]
  },
